<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Datatec warns in talks.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Datatec warns in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics group Datatec Ltd said on Wednesday it was involved in talks which could affect the company's share price if succesful.</p>
<p>The company warned shareholders to exercise caution in share dealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
